  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COWI - Technical Assistance to the Drinking Water Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance is intended to strengthen the capacities of those implementing the Drinking Water project to take ownership of new approaches and themes, planning, programming, feasibility studies, summary preliminary projects and detailed preliminary draft concerning the realization of investments and their management.</narrative>
